    <object>
      <id>MEDLISTPH.1.5#03</id>
      <name>PH.1.5#03</name>
      <notes>The system SHOULD provide the ability to manage consent directives and authorizations according to user preference, organizational policy, and/or jurisdictional law (e.g., capturing the PHR Account Holder's personal representative‚Äôs authority (such as a note from the PHR Account Holder or a pointer to a legal document) to enable decisions to be made on behalf of the PHR Account Holder).</notes>
      <stereotype>CI</stereotype>
      <type>Class</type>
